{:frontmatter
 {:id "adr-2607102300-kotoba-lang-standard-model-gtg-phase1-field-equations-scope"
  :title "ADR-2607102300: kotoba-lang/standard-model — opening Phase 1 (GTG field equations / the h-Omega relation), superseding the action-principle-out-of-scope boundary for this one item"
  :status "accepted"
  :date "2026-07-09"
  :deciders ["Jun Kawasaki"]
  :doc_type "adr"
  :topic "kotoba-lang-standard-model"
  :authoritative true
  :authoritative_for
  ["opens Phase 1 (GTG field equations) as a deliberate, scoped exception to
    ADR-2607051500/ADR-2607101700's 'action principle and field equations out
    of scope' boundary -- narrowly for the source-free Omega-field equation of
    motion (GTG's vanishing-torsion / first-Cartan-structure-equation analogue)
    and, contingent on that, the true LDG linear curvature scalar"
   "context: Phase 0d (PR #7) and Phase 0e (PR #8) independently hit the same
    wall from different angles while chasing the curvature scalar -- Phase 0d
    found unresolved index/sign risk translating R_munu into a scalar; Phase 0e
    found there is NO h_mu(x)->Omega_mu(x) correspondence anywhere in this
    codebase (GTG's h is not an ordinary-GR tetrad, both indices live in the
    same flat background space, tetrad-postulate formula does not transfer
    verbatim). Root cause: h and Omega are independent gauge potentials in GTG
    by construction; their relation only appears as the equation of motion from
    varying the action w.r.t. Omega -- unreachable without touching the action
    principle"
   "Phase 1 scope: (1) GTG gravitational action, vacuum/source-free only, no
    matter coupling/cosmological-constant/Yang-Mills-Dirac-Higgs terms folded
    in; (2) the Omega-field equation of motion from varying that action w.r.t.
    Omega, giving Omega algebraically in terms of h and its derivatives in the
    source-free case; (3) only after (1)-(2) land with independent numeric
    verification, revisit the true curvature scalar R"
   "explicitly STILL out of scope, unchanged: matter coupling to gravity, the
    Einstein multivector/stress-energy sourcing, any GR-equivalence proof (cited
    as established 1998 literature result, not re-derived), quantization/RGE/
    scattering/lattice, dark-sector/de-Sitter extension -- Phase 1 is bounded to
    source-free Omega(h) + contingent curvature scalar only"
   "verification bar for any Phase 1 PR (given PR #6's real slot-order bug and
    Phase 0d/0e's honest declines on exactly this class of derivation): at least
    2 independent mutually-corroborating primary/secondary literature sources
    for the exact equation, AND a genuine independent numeric check (reproduce a
    literature worked example, or cross-check against linearized-GR
    vanishing-torsion in a simple case) -- not merely 'the formula matches the
    PDF on one read'. If the bar cannot be cleared, the correct outcome is
    another honest non-implementation writeup (same as Phase 0d/0e), not a
    lowered bar"
   "this ADR changes no code by itself -- a follow-up landing-record ADR should
    document what actually merges, mirroring the ADR-2607101700 ->
    ADR-2607101900 scope-then-landing pattern; if Phase 1 succeeds it would be
    the first genuine GTG FIELD EQUATION (not just field-content algebra) in
    this repo, a qualitative change from every prior ADR's framing that should
    be revisited explicitly in the landing ADR, not left stale"
   "if Phase 1 fails to clear the verification bar (a live possibility -- two
    prior adjacent-angle attempts both failed), the curvature-scalar chase
    should not be reopened a further time without a materially new approach
    (literature worked-example cross-check, independent expert consultation),
    not another literature re-read"]
